--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dataset Carve-Out & Third-Party Asset Exceptions:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Lens Calibration Database (`assets/lensfun/`):
   The pre-indexed lens and camera calibration profiles bundled in `assets/lensfun/`
   are derived from the open-source Lensfun project and are licensed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License (CC-BY-SA 3.0).
   See `assets/lensfun/LICENSE.txt` and `THIRDPARTY.md` for full terms and attribution.
   Under mere aggregation principles, this dataset license does not extend to
   or affect First Proof application source code or binaries.

2. Third-Party Libraries & Dependencies:
   Additional open-source software libraries incorporated or linked into First Proof
   are subject to their respective upstream licenses as detailed in `THIRDPARTY.md`.
